937-convention-the-firetouched-movement?p=366327#post366327\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Forget Rabid Wolf's curs; I want to know what they have to do with Prometheans!</div> </div> </div> </div>Oddly enough, I was thinking that the movement could be the physical embodiment of the Vigil it's self. Started off as a Rabid Wolf cult but actions of the group start to affect the spirits leading them which in turn eventually lead to the Pure leaders being outed as Werewolves and are either imprisoned to &quot;cure&quot; back to humanity or have died via the hands of their own cult.<br /> <br /> At this point, The spirits and the cult have merged so much that you can't tell them apart any more. Granted there aren't any Claimed or even Ridden among them (to have a spirit do so would be beaten up by the others as a matter of course) but if one was to flee into the Shadow after being chased down by a cell, they would be run straight into a pack of spirits who are hunting the same creature. <br /> <br /> As above, so below.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:08:55-08:00","id":368140,"title":"","content":"Well they can gain attributes, and dread powers, what about natural abilities of a being that could be represented as a dread power?<br /> <br /> So the claws of a werewolf are fair game, what about the claws of a tiger? <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T21:28:22-08:00","id":368268,"title":"","content":"It depends, are they represented as a Dread Power?<br /> <br /> Remember, your donor <i>needs</i> to have at least 3 dots in whatever they are &quot;donating&quot; - so if that Tiger has 3L claws or fangs, they can be transferred.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}